---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Contact D&D Land Works | Free Estimates — Lane County, OR"
	description="Call or email D&D Land Works for a free excavation, grading, or septic estimate. Serving Eugene, Springfield, and Lane County, OR."
>
	<Hero
		eyebrow="Get in Touch"
		headline="Free Estimates, No Pressure"
		subheadline="Call, text, or email with what you need done and where. David will ask a few questions about the site and set up a time to walk it."
		primaryCta={{ label: 'Call 541-401-8726', href: 'tel:5414018726' }}
	/>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2">
		<div class="card">
			<h2 class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-xl text-ink">Call or Text</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Fastest way to reach us. Leave a message if it goes to voicemail and we'll call back.</p>
			<a href="tel:5414018726" class="btn btn-cta mt-4">541-401-8726</a>
		</div>
		<div class="card">
			<h2 class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-xl text-ink">Email</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">Include your address or nearest cross-street, what you need done, and a couple photos if you have them.</p>
			<a href="mailto:david@ddlandworks.com" class="btn btn-outline mt-4">david@ddlandworks.com</a>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-16">
		<h2 class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-2xl text-ink">
			Before You Reach Out
		</h2>
		<p class="mt-4 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
			A faster estimate usually comes down to three things: the address, what you're trying to get
			done (new driveway, septic repair, a pad cut for a shop, etc.), and anything unusual about
			access, like a steep grade or a gate that needs a code. Photos help but aren't required.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-4 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
			Licensed and bonded under CCB #261742, DEQ certified for septic work. Serving Eugene,
			Springfield, and the rest of <a href="/service-area" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-blue-dark">Lane County</a>.
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
